<title>USA: Markel Corp Q3 net slips.</title>
<headline>Markel Corp Q3 net slips.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				   September 30,	 September 30,</p>
<p>				    1996	1995     1996	1995</p>
<p>		    (dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>Total operating revenues</p>
<p>				  $90,367  $91,543 $267,029  $250,633</p>
<p>   Net income		   8,469    8,984   42,369    23,876</p>
